  "created": "2022-06-13T23:17:08.370Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The VRC Phys Bones are missing the friction option that Dynamic Bones had. Without it, it's near impossible to create e.g. a skirt that flows with phys bones while at the same time not clipping with leg movements, since the phys bones of the skirt will just slip off either side of the leg collider instead of moving with it.",
